se the digests call Nadia's industrial account Vantorre Group. Confirm that match.\n- **Hartford incident:** The 8/3 digest describes a Hartford Sev 1 but gives no ticket number.\n\nExcluded as not Vantorre Group: #4812 (Vantorre Mobility, March 2025) and #PD-4402 (Quillfeather Outfitters).\n\nI only checked those three sources, so tickets that exist only in the ticketing system won't appear here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
